"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/privacy","style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:style","children":"the Privacy Policy"}]," ","that is available on the Website and is an integral part of the Agreement. Such acceptance constitutes full and unconditional consent to all provisions hereof."]}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 20px)","fontWeight":800,"color":"#f4f4f6","margin":"2.5em 0 0.8em","letterSpacing":"0.02em"},"children":"I. DEFINITIONS"}],[["$","p","1.1.",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f4f4f6"},"children":"1.1."}]," ","'Account Balance' means the aggregate amount of funds in the Client's Account, excluding any Open Trades, and represents the Company's financial liability to the Client at a given time, unless otherwise provided."]}],["$","p","1.2.",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f4f4f6"},"children":"1.2."}]," ","'AI Trading' means the functionality accessible in the Client's Personal Account that enables the Client to make Trading Transactions using artificial intelligence."]}],["$","p","1.3.",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f4f4f6"},"children":"1.3."}]," ","'Asset' means currency pairs, commodities, contracts, stocks and stock indices available for trading via financial instruments on the Website."]}],["$","p","1.4.",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f4f4f6"},"children":"1.4."}]," ","A 'Benefit' means an item available for purchase or exchange for Stockens by the Client within the Market."]}],["$","p","1.5.",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"sty